 during manufacturing processes.\r\nThe Task Definition is created with the following Task Parameters:\r\n- RequirementTag,\r\n- EquipmentToAllocate,\r\n- AllocatedEquipment.\r\nThe Task Context Definition EquipmentAllocationTaskContextDefinition is associated to the created Task Definition.","FullInfo":"Creates a new Equipment Allocation Task Definition.\r\nEquipment Allocation Task Definitions are designed for instantiating Tasks used to allocate equipment during manufacturing processes.\r\nThe Task Definition is created with the following Task Parameters:\r\n- RequirementTag,\r\n- EquipmentToAllocate,\r\n- AllocatedEquipment.\r\nThe Task Context Definition EquipmentAllocationTaskContextDefinition is associated to the created Task Definition.","InfoMap":{"$id":"272","FullIdObj":{"$id":"273","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Creates a new Equipment Allocation Task Definition.\r\nEquipment Allocation Task Definitions are designed for instantiating Tasks used to allocate equipment during manufacturing processes.\r\nThe Task Definition is created with the following Task Parameters:\r\n- RequirementTag,\r\n- EquipmentToAllocate,\r\n- AllocatedEquipment.\r\nThe Task Context Definition EquipmentAllocationTaskContextDefinition is associated to the created Task Definition.","FullInfo":"Creates a new Equipment Allocation Task Definition.\r\nEquipment Allocation Task Definitions are designed for instantiating Tasks used to allocate equipment during manufacturing processes.\r\nThe Task Definition is created with the following Task Parameters:\r\n- RequirementTag,\r\n- EquipmentToAllocate,\r\n- AllocatedEquipment.\r\nThe Task Context Definition EquipmentAllocationTaskContextDefinition is associated to the created Task Definition.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"273"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Creates a new Equipment Allocation Task Definition.\r\nEquipment Allocation Task Definitions are designed for instantiating Tasks used to allocate equipment during manufacturing processes.\r\nThe Task Definition is created with the following Task Parameters:\r\n- RequirementTag,\r\n- EquipmentToAllocate,\r\n- AllocatedEquipment.\r\nThe Task Context Definition EquipmentAllocationTaskContextDefinition is associated to the created Task Definition.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Creates a new Equipment Allocation Task Definition.\r\nEquipment Allocation Task Definitions are designed for instantiating Tasks used to allocate equipment during manufacturing processes.\r\nThe Task Definition is created with the following Task Parameters:\r\n- RequirementTag,\r\n- EquipmentToAllocate,\r\n- AllocatedEquipment.\r\nThe Task Context Definition EquipmentAllocationTaskContextDefinition is associated to the created Task Definition."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"274","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"133"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"275","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(7b63073a-61c1-4292-9aee-a35e8e1e81f9)","FullInfo":"@Guid(7b63073a-61c1-4292-9aee-a35e8e1e81f9)","InfoMap":{"$id":"276","FullIdObj":{"$id":"277","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(7b63073a-61c1-4292-9aee-a35e8e1e81f9)","FullInfo":"@Guid(7b63073a-61c1-4292-9aee-a35e8e1e81f9)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"277"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"133"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(7b63073a-61c1-4292-9aee-a35e8e1e81f9)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(7b63073a-61c1-4292-9aee-a35e8e1e81f9)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"CreateEquipmentAllocationTaskDefinition","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"CreateEquipmentAllocationTaskDefinition"},{"$id":"278","