iguration. If none exists, it creates empty ones.\r\nThe command performs the following checks:\r\n1. if the given Equipment Configuration Id exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n2. if the given Equipment Configuration is not Frozen, if it is error 10992 is returned;\r\n3. if the given AllocationStateMachineNId exists, if not error 11210 is returned.","FullInfo":"Updates extended process properties for the given Equipment Configuration. If none exists, it creates empty ones.\r\nThe command performs the following checks:\r\n1. if the given Equipment Configuration Id exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n2. if the given Equipment Configuration is not Frozen, if it is error 10992 is returned;\r\n3. if the given AllocationStateMachineNId exists, if not error 11210 is returned.","InfoMap":{"$id":"380","FullIdObj":{"$id":"381","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Updates extended process properties for the given Equipment Configuration. If none exists, it creates empty ones.\r\nThe command performs the following checks:\r\n1. if the given Equipment Configuration Id exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n2. if the given Equipment Configuration is not Frozen, if it is error 10992 is returned;\r\n3. if the given AllocationStateMachineNId exists, if not error 11210 is returned.","FullInfo":"Updates extended process properties for the given Equipment Configuration. If none exists, it creates empty ones.\r\nThe command performs the following checks:\r\n1. if the given Equipment Configuration Id exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n2. if the given Equipment Configuration is not Frozen, if it is error 10992 is returned;\r\n3. if the given AllocationStateMachineNId exists, if not error 11210 is returned.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"381"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Updates extended process properties for the given Equipment Configuration. If none exists, it creates empty ones.\r\nThe command performs the following checks:\r\n1. if the given Equipment Configuration Id exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n2. if the given Equipment Configuration is not Frozen, if it is error 10992 is returned;\r\n3. if the given AllocationStateMachineNId exists, if not error 11210 is returned.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Updates extended process properties for the given Equipment Configuration. If none exists, it creates empty ones.\r\nThe command performs the following checks:\r\n1. if the given Equipment Configuration Id exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n2. if the given Equipment Configuration is not Frozen, if it is error 10992 is returned;\r\n3. if the given AllocationStateMachineNId exists, if not error 11210 is returned."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"382","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"133"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"383","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(f93ddf2a-a9f8-4e67-a9f9-f2c497d47e4b)","FullInfo":"@Guid(f93ddf2a-a9f8-4e67-a9f9-f2c497d47e4b)","InfoMap":{"$id":"384","FullIdObj":{"$id":"385","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(f93ddf2a-a9f8-4e67-a9f9-f2c497d47e4b)","FullInfo":"@Guid(f93ddf2a-a9f8-4e67-a9f9-f2c497d47e4b)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"385"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"133"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(f93ddf2a-a9f8-4e67-a9f9-f2c497d47e4b)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(f93ddf2a-a9f8-4e67-a9f9-f2c497d47e4b)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"UpdateEquipmentAllocationPropertiesConfiguration","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"UpdateEquipmentAllocationPropertiesConfiguration"},{"$id":"386","$type":"DslCommandInputDeclarationTree","Child