ates extended Equipment Allocation properties for the given Equipment Configuration if none exists.\r\nList of properties: \r\n   - AllocationStateMachineNId: The identifier of the State Machine on which the system will rely on, in order to manage the allocation state of the piece of Equipment (respective to this Equipment Configuration). \r\nThe command performs a check on the Equipment Configuration Id to see if it exists.\r\nIf not, error 11214 is returned.","FullInfo":"Creates extended Equipment Allocation properties for the given Equipment Configuration if none exists.\r\nList of properties: \r\n   - AllocationStateMachineNId: The identifier of the State Machine on which the system will rely on, in order to manage the allocation state of the piece of Equipment (respective to this Equipment Configuration). \r\nThe command performs a check on the Equipment Configuration Id to see if it exists.\r\nIf not, error 11214 is returned.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"426"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Creates extended Equipment Allocation properties for the given Equipment Configuration if none exists.\r\nList of properties: \r\n   - AllocationStateMachineNId: The identifier of the State Machine on which the system will rely on, in order to manage the allocation state of the piece of Equipment (respective to this Equipment Configuration). \r\nThe command performs a check on the Equipment Configuration Id to see if it exists.\r\nIf not, error 11214 is returned.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Creates extended Equipment Allocation properties for the given Equipment Configuration if none exists.\r\nList of properties: \r\n   - AllocationStateMachineNId: The identifier of the State Machine on which the system will rely on, in order to manage the allocation state of the piece of Equipment (respective to this Equipment Configuration). \r\nThe command performs a check o